---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Member spotlight
description: Each day a Rotary District 3110 member's profession and how they serve through it, and the moderators' stories.
permalink: /spotlight/
scripts: ["spotlight.js"]
# kept out of search engines and the sitemap while there is nothing on it
eleventyComputed:
  noindex: "{% if not site.has.spotlight %}yes{% endif %}"
---
{% from "macros.njk" import avatar, spotlightEntry %}
<div class="wrap section narrow">
  <h1>Member spotlight</h1>
  <p class="lead">One member each day, in their own words: members in business and service who chose to be featured. Everyone has a turn before anyone comes back.</p>
  {%- if site.spotlightToday %}
  <h2>Today</h2>
  <article class="message-card featured" data-spotlight-today="full">{{ spotlightEntry(site.spotlightToday, true) }}</article>
  {%- if site.spotlightRecent.length %}
  <h2>The last few days</h2>
  <ul class="spotlight-recent" data-spotlight-recent>
    {%- for e in site.spotlightRecent %}<li class="message-card">{{ spotlightEntry(e) }}</li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if site.spotlights.length %}
  <h2>Stories by the moderators</h2>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- for s in site.spotlights %}
  <article class="message-card" id="{{ s.month }}">
    <header>
      {{ avatar(s.member.name, s.image.sq.src if s.image else '', 72) }}
      <div><p class="meta">{{ s.monthLabel }}</p><h2>{% if s.card %}<a href="{{ s.card }}">{{ s.member.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ s.member.name }}{% endif %}</h2>
        {%- if s.club %}<p class="role">{% if s.member.profession %}{{ s.member.profession }} · {% endif %}<a href="{{ s.club.url }}">{{ s.club.name }}</a></p>{% endif %}</div>
    </header>
    <h3>{{ s.headline }}</h3>
    <p>{{ s.story }}</p>
    {%- if s.member.website %}<p><a href="{{ s.member.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website ↗</a></p>{% endif %}
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
  {%- if not site.spotlightToday and not site.spotlights.length %}
  <p>The first spotlight will appear here soon.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="small">Happy to be featured? Choose List for "member spotlight" on the <a href="/consent/">Show my details form</a>, and give your profession, a few lines on what you do, and a photo on the <a href="/update/">Update my details form</a>.</p>
</div>
